WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:01.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:02.240 --> 02:04.240
Shouldn't you be swamped by the project?

3
02:04.320 --> 02:06.200
How do you have time to come back and space out here?

4
02:07.360 --> 02:09.639
I wasn't spacing out. I was thinking.

5
02:11.039 --> 02:13.200
I'm just organizing some materials.

6
02:13.280 --> 02:15.280
Celestial doesn't have a place for me to work,

7
02:15.360 --> 02:16.680
so I came back to the office.

8
02:18.120 --> 02:20.600
-Looks like what they're saying is true. -What's true?

9
02:23.600 --> 02:25.680
You and Yang Rui made a huge fool of yourselves

10
02:25.760 --> 02:26.960
in front of the Celestial client.

11
02:27.040 --> 02:28.840
You threw away all the goodwill

12
02:28.920 --> 02:30.160
we built with the client after they accepted the overall plan.

13
02:30.760 --> 02:31.960
Now they won't even give you a workstation.

14
02:32.720 --> 02:34.320
Don't talk nonsense!

15
02:46.400 --> 02:48.000
Who told you that? Don't go spreading that around.

16
02:48.600 --> 02:50.160
I'm just giving you a heads-up.

17
02:50.240 --> 02:52.440
You've been in the spotlight too much.

18
02:52.520 --> 02:54.440
A lot of people at the company are waiting to see you fall.

19
02:58.040 --> 03:00.920
Just now at the meeting, someone told Sha Sha you're too arrogant.

20
03:01.560 --> 03:04.400
They said you argued with Tianna in front of the client at Celestial.

21
03:04.480 --> 03:06.200
I didn't argue with her.

22
03:06.280 --> 03:08.000
I was just bickering with her.

23
03:08.080 --> 03:10.040
I know. But other people don't.

24
03:10.800 --> 03:11.800
So I'm just reminding you.

25
03:11.880 --> 03:12.920
One, tone it down.

26
03:13.000 --> 03:15.640
Two, if something goes wrong with Yang Rui,

27
03:15.720 --> 03:16.680
don't take the fall for him.

28
03:17.480 --> 03:18.800
He doesn't listen to me at all.

29
03:19.400 --> 03:20.280
And he's my boyfriend.

30
03:20.360 --> 03:22.240
I can't go complain about him to Ma Ke.

31
03:24.880 --> 03:25.720
That's it then.

32
03:36.920 --> 03:38.840
You believe gossip like that?

33
03:38.920 --> 03:40.440
That's not like you.

34
03:41.120 --> 03:42.920
If you feel uncomfortable being at the office alone,

35
03:43.000 --> 03:44.040
I'll come back to keep you company next Monday.

36
03:44.120 --> 03:46.360
I don't need you to keep me company.

37
03:46.880 --> 03:49.240
I want to draft a new proposal for their IT Department,

38
03:49.320 --> 03:51.600
so they can see our sincerity and capability.

39
03:51.680 --> 03:54.360
At least so they don't think Maxmise is all talk and no action.

40
03:54.440 --> 03:56.040
Ma Ke said to put it on hold.

41
03:56.120 --> 03:57.320
He'll handle it.

42
03:57.400 --> 03:58.960
Can you not go off on your own like this?

43
04:01.520 --> 04:03.800
Sorry. I sounded harsh just now.

44
04:03.880 --> 04:04.840
Don't take it to heart.

45
04:05.520 --> 04:07.640
I just think you shouldn't keep butting heads with Ma Ke.

46
04:07.720 --> 04:09.040
-After all, last time-- -I know.

47
04:09.960 --> 04:10.800
Alright.

48
04:10.880 --> 04:12.680
Celestial is having a team-building event this weekend, isn't it?

49
04:12.760 --> 04:14.640
We can go out together on our day off.

50
04:14.720 --> 04:15.560
How about Huanying World?

51
04:18.160 --> 04:19.880
Sure. We'll figure it out later.

52
04:32.160 --> 04:34.040
YE XINZHI

53
04:34.120 --> 04:35.880
Tonight at 8:30. J Center, 120th Floor.

54
04:36.680 --> 04:37.960
I'm meeting with the MD of Morse Investment Bank

55
04:38.040 --> 04:39.760
to broker a deal for Tianhe Air.

56
04:39.840 --> 04:41.320
Can you come be my temporary secretary?

57
04:59.160 --> 05:00.280
Your first time here?

58
05:13.200 --> 05:14.360
Yeah.

59
05:14.960 --> 05:17.200
So I just took a bunch of photos and posted them on Moments.

60
05:17.840 --> 05:19.120
Once you've been here a few dozen times,

61
05:19.200 --> 05:21.720
you'll only complain about how long the elevator takes.

62
05:24.600 --> 05:26.360
But even then,

63
05:26.440 --> 05:29.440
face-to-face time with Morse's MD is still rare.

64
05:35.280 --> 05:37.320
We're here to discuss the Tianhe plan today.

65
05:37.400 --> 05:41.040
Isn't your outfit a bit too casual?

66
05:41.800 --> 05:43.040
I've known him for a long time.

67
05:43.120 --> 05:45.600
Dressing too formally actually feels a bit odd.

68
05:50.000 --> 05:51.320
But what you're wearing is just right.

69
05:51.400 --> 05:52.240
Relax.

70
05:52.320 --> 05:53.840
Relax, and you'll be at your best.

71
05:59.160 --> 06:00.160
Relax.

72
06:00.240 --> 06:02.680
Don't forget how you bragged to Tianna.

73
06:02.760 --> 06:05.480
How come the moment you meet, you're the only one freaking out?

74
06:05.560 --> 06:07.560
Thank you for the postcard you sent me.

75
06:08.080 --> 06:10.200
The small building in the picture is exactly the same as I remember.

76
06:10.280 --> 06:12.080
-Happy? -Yeah.

77
06:12.160 --> 06:13.320
Then I'm even happier.

78
06:23.800 --> 06:26.240
Foul. That's just foul.

79
06:29.880 --> 06:31.320
What would you two like to drink?

80
06:31.400 --> 06:32.480
-Jiwa. -Jiwa, thanks.

81
06:34.080 --> 06:35.480
You two are so in sync.

82
06:36.440 --> 06:37.720
-I'll have an Americano. -Sure, sir.

83
06:37.800 --> 06:39.000
-Mr. Deng. -Mr. Ye.

84
06:39.080 --> 06:40.040
Let me introduce you.

85
06:40.120 --> 06:41.360
This is my assistant, Chi.

86
06:41.960 --> 06:43.440
-Hello. I'm Xu Chi. -Hello.

87
07:06.200 --> 07:08.440
If this deal goes through, I really have to thank you.

88
07:09.240 --> 07:10.400
Why be so formal with me?

89
07:10.480 --> 07:12.040
I happen to be consulting for Tianhe.

90
07:12.120 --> 07:13.800
I know they have investment needs,

91
07:13.880 --> 07:16.040
and I know you've got plenty of capital.

92
07:16.120 --> 07:17.280
It's just a small favor.

93
07:18.160 --> 07:20.920
Tianhe really hit the jackpot hiring you as consultants.

94
07:21.880 --> 07:25.280
Miss Xu, please organize the meeting minutes when you get back.

95
07:25.360 --> 07:27.360
Once I receive them tomorrow, I'll reach out to them right away.

96
07:28.160 --> 07:29.120
Already sent to your email.

97
07:31.840 --> 07:33.160
I trained her personally.

98
07:33.240 --> 07:34.560
Very fast.

99
07:34.640 --> 07:36.120
And her accuracy is just as good.

100
07:36.960 --> 07:38.160
I'm not worried about that.

101
07:38.240 --> 07:39.280
Because just now,

102
07:39.360 --> 07:41.000
many of Miss Xu's points really impressed me.

103
07:41.920 --> 07:44.440
Miss Xu, would you consider joining my company?

104
07:47.720 --> 07:49.760
I've long heard that the chef at Morse's Beijing headquarters

105
07:49.840 --> 07:54.200
elite staff restaurant was hired from a top five-star hotel.

106
07:54.720 --> 07:57.160
If you'd like to take me along for a good meal,

107
07:57.240 --> 07:58.080
I can leave right now.

108
07:58.680 --> 07:59.640
Let's go.

109
08:00.240 --> 08:02.360
Deng. Poaching in front of me, huh?

110
08:04.120 --> 08:05.840
Joking aside.

111
08:05.920 --> 08:08.920
You know, I really admire you guys.

112
08:09.000 --> 08:11.040
No matter what industry you consult for,

113
08:11.120 --> 08:12.600
you're always so professional.

114
08:12.680 --> 08:15.160
Consultants are supposed to know the industry better than the clients.

115
08:15.760 --> 08:18.840
You can't just pull a random case from the files and churn out a proposal.

116
08:19.360 --> 08:21.360
Fooling the client and fooling yourself?

117
08:21.880 --> 08:23.680
That's not how I do things.

118
08:23.760 --> 08:25.280
That's what makes you impressive.

119
08:25.800 --> 08:26.800
Maxmise isn't magic.

120
08:26.880 --> 08:28.880
How could we possibly know every company's technical details?

121
08:28.960 --> 08:31.120
Just showing them a tiny bit is more than enough.

122
08:31.200 --> 08:32.280
Let's wish us success.

123
08:32.360 --> 08:33.559
Success.

124
08:55.920 --> 08:57.880
You're not still thinking about Celestial's IT Department, are you?

125
09:00.160 --> 09:01.120
No.

126
09:01.200 --> 09:02.760
I… I was moved by the movie.

127
09:05.320 --> 09:06.480
This is a comedy.

128
09:12.280 --> 09:15.280
Laughing through tears is what makes it really touching.

129
09:18.080 --> 09:19.480
I'm going to the restroom.

130
09:38.600 --> 09:40.040
So embarrassing.

131
09:47.360 --> 09:48.440
Xu Chi.

132
09:49.760 --> 09:53.080
Lin? What a coincidence. Are you here to see a movie too?

133
09:53.160 --> 09:54.600
I saw you earlier.

134
09:55.360 --> 09:56.960
I wanted to thank you for helping me find that agent.

135
09:57.040 --> 09:59.880
I've finished moving, and the divorce is done.

136
09:59.960 --> 10:01.240
I feel totally free.

137
10:01.320 --> 10:04.560
So I wanted to catch a few movies before my leave ends, just to relax.

138
10:04.640 --> 10:05.840
That's great.

139
10:07.160 --> 10:09.560
I think I saw you come in with Yang Rui earlier.

140
10:11.320 --> 10:12.400
Yeah.

141
10:12.480 --> 10:14.560
We haven't been together long.

142
10:16.920 --> 10:18.400
I thought I was seeing things.

143
10:18.480 --> 10:20.160
How did you end up with Yang Rui?

144
10:21.240 --> 10:22.200
Is there something wrong with him?

145
10:22.800 --> 10:24.200
No, that's not what I meant.

146
10:24.800 --> 10:26.760
He joined the company two years after me,

147
10:26.840 --> 10:28.360
but he's a good consultant.

148
10:28.440 --> 10:30.680
He's a decent guy with a good personality.

149
10:31.640 --> 10:32.560
Then why…?

150
10:33.680 --> 10:36.640
I just thought you and Ye Xinzhi were pretty close before.

151
10:36.720 --> 10:38.680
I assumed you two…

152
10:38.760 --> 10:40.760
No, no. You've got it wrong.

153
10:42.800 --> 10:44.640
My family and he are friends.

154
10:49.560 --> 10:52.640
Actually, years ago, Richard was my mentor.

155
10:53.160 --> 10:55.680
He really is charming.

156
10:55.760 --> 10:59.600
I even had a little crush on him once.

157
11:00.800 --> 11:03.720
But looking back now, it was probably just admiration.

158
11:05.000 --> 11:06.800
I interned under him at Boen for over half a year,

159
11:06.880 --> 11:08.920
so I know him very well.

160
11:09.000 --> 11:10.560
He's very cautious.

161
11:10.640 --> 11:11.960
So cautious that he'd never

162
11:12.040 --> 11:14.200
go to dinner alone with a female colleague.

163
11:14.280 --> 11:16.800
So that night when I saw him drunk and leaning on you,

164
11:16.880 --> 11:18.640
I got really angry.

165
11:19.160 --> 11:20.040
But that proved

166
11:20.120 --> 11:23.000
he'd already let you into his inner circle.

167
11:24.080 --> 11:26.880
And I could tell you have feelings for him.

168
11:27.520 --> 11:30.680
-Lin, I… -You don't have to rush to deny it.

169
11:31.400 --> 11:35.120
The fact that I can say all this openly shows I've long since let it go.

170
11:35.720 --> 11:38.680
His type is what young girls fall for.

171
11:38.760 --> 11:40.600
I'm way past liking that type now.

172
11:44.040 --> 11:45.080
You should get going.

173
11:45.160 --> 11:46.000
See you at the office.

174
11:53.680 --> 11:54.880
FISH SPINNERS

175
12:09.920 --> 12:11.240
Look at that.

176
12:19.880 --> 12:22.200
BEIJING HAPPY VALLEY

177
12:33.600 --> 12:38.480
LONG TIME NO SIP, TIPSY BAR

178
12:38.560 --> 12:40.600
-Let's buy some water. -Sure.

179
12:42.920 --> 12:44.000
Here.

180
12:44.520 --> 12:45.880
This water is pretty expensive, isn't it?

181
12:47.360 --> 12:48.680
I grabbed the wrong one.

182
12:48.760 --> 12:49.600
Which one do you want?

183
12:51.120 --> 12:53.080
Hello. Two bottles of this, please.

184
12:53.160 --> 12:54.480
-That's 20 total. -Okay.

185
12:55.080 --> 12:56.160
-Let me. -I'll pay.

186
12:56.240 --> 12:57.080
Let me.

187
12:59.760 --> 13:01.360
Alright. Thanks.

188
13:02.920 --> 13:04.120
Thank you.

189
13:22.880 --> 13:23.720
Lin.

190
13:24.360 --> 13:25.680
Back then,

191
13:26.400 --> 13:30.040
how did you control your feelings for him?

192
13:31.680 --> 13:33.920
I left Boen and joined Maxmise.

193
13:38.200 --> 13:39.280
Yang Rui is my "Maxmise".

194
13:42.280 --> 13:43.360
I get it.

195
13:44.840 --> 13:45.920
I won't try to talk you out of it.

196
13:46.000 --> 13:47.280
After all, you know only

197
13:47.360 --> 13:49.320
if a relationship is worth it once you've been in it.

198
13:49.920 --> 13:52.400
But as someone who's been divorced, let me share one piece of experience.

199
13:52.480 --> 13:54.720
If you're with someone you like,

200
13:54.800 --> 13:55.880
no matter how busy or tired you are,

201
13:55.960 --> 13:57.520
you'll be happy.

202
13:58.040 --> 14:01.560
But if you're with someone you don't like that much,

203
14:01.640 --> 14:04.360
you won't last long before you get tired.

204
14:06.400 --> 14:07.440
Yang Rui.

205
14:07.520 --> 14:08.880
-I-- -Let's break up.

206
14:12.800 --> 14:15.640
Actually, I've been wanting to say this to you.

207
14:15.720 --> 14:17.520
I just didn't know how.

208
14:18.240 --> 14:21.480
Honestly, when we first got together, I was really happy.

209
14:21.560 --> 14:25.800
But over time, I realized there was no real spark between us.

210
14:27.520 --> 14:29.000
We're just not meant to be together.

211
14:29.840 --> 14:33.720
Because we're interested in different things.

212
14:34.480 --> 14:37.040
And every time we go on a date, we're not on the same page.

213
14:37.600 --> 14:40.680
We were always just trying it out anyway.

214
14:40.760 --> 14:43.240
But I figured if one day

215
14:43.320 --> 14:45.400
you dumped me first, that'd be pretty embarrassing.

216
14:45.920 --> 14:47.680
So I might as well beat you to it.

217
14:51.840 --> 14:54.880
Where are your manners? Whatever happened to "ladies first"?

218
14:56.600 --> 14:58.800
We're both corporate drones. Let's not bother with gender.

219
15:00.960 --> 15:02.640
-We're still good colleagues. -Of course.

220
15:03.760 --> 15:05.200
And friends.

221
15:06.760 --> 15:07.640
Good breakup.

222
15:07.720 --> 15:10.240
You and Yang Rui never had any chemistry anyway.

223
15:10.320 --> 15:11.960
And you getting publicly criticized

224
15:12.040 --> 15:15.200
by Mr. Sun from Celestial's IT Department was all thanks to him.

225
15:17.040 --> 15:19.560
We talked it over. Since we broke up,

226
15:19.640 --> 15:21.280
staying in the same project team would be awkward,

227
15:21.360 --> 15:23.120
so I want to apply for a transfer to another team.

228
15:23.200 --> 15:24.720
Come to our team.

229
15:24.800 --> 15:27.400
Let's really join forces and do something big together.

230
15:27.480 --> 15:28.480
Sure.

231
15:29.120 --> 15:30.720
I think there's too much dust

232
15:30.800 --> 15:33.160
in your router, so it's overheating, and the WiFi keeps dropping.

233
15:33.240 --> 15:34.680
Let me wipe it down. That should fix it.

234
15:36.360 --> 15:37.480
Now

235
15:38.800 --> 15:40.680
you've broken up with Yang Rui.

236
15:40.760 --> 15:41.880
You're single again.

237
15:41.960 --> 15:43.920
How are you moving things forward with Ye Xinzhi?

238
15:44.520 --> 15:46.160
Move what forward?

239
15:46.240 --> 15:47.840
Just go back to how things were.

240
15:47.920 --> 15:50.640
Once you've had the best, nobody else compares.

241
15:50.720 --> 15:51.880
Since I like him,

242
15:51.960 --> 15:54.280
I won't force myself to be with someone else.

243
15:55.040 --> 15:56.240
I'm just not good enough for him right now.

244
15:56.320 --> 15:57.920
Then I'll work for it.

245
15:58.000 --> 16:01.000
I'll learn from him while keeping things flirtatious.

246
16:01.080 --> 16:02.440
Maybe one day I'll deserve him.

247
16:02.520 --> 16:04.680
Then I'll have both career and love.

248
16:06.200 --> 16:08.760
"Once you've had the best, nobody else compares"?

249
16:09.800 --> 16:11.040
Have you even had him?

250
16:11.800 --> 16:13.160
Have you even been through anything?

251
16:13.240 --> 16:14.480
That's just a secret crush.

252
16:14.560 --> 16:16.040
Don't flatter yourself.

253
16:19.440 --> 16:20.680
Let me tell you,

254
16:20.760 --> 16:22.320
after we met with Mr. Deng from Morse that day,

255
16:22.400 --> 16:24.960
Ye Xinzhi drove me back to the hotel. He sat in the back seat with me.

256
16:25.040 --> 16:28.760
I have a feeling if he knew I broke up, he'd be pretty happy.

257
16:29.720 --> 16:31.080
What are you laughing at?

258
16:31.640 --> 16:34.040
The two of you are worlds apart in status.

259
16:34.120 --> 16:35.520
He's way up there.

260
16:35.600 --> 16:37.240
Should he sit in the front instead of the back?

261
16:37.320 --> 16:40.960
Besides, if some young girl were putting herself on a silver platter for me,

262
16:41.040 --> 16:42.160
I'd be loving it too.

263
16:43.680 --> 16:44.640
I'm not fixing your router.

264
16:44.720 --> 16:46.200
Just leave it. Let the WiFi stay broken.

265
16:46.280 --> 16:48.400
-I'm done. -Can't handle…

266
16:48.480 --> 16:49.960
Can't handle facing reality?

267
16:52.320 --> 16:55.480
Anyway, he's not the kind of textbook scumbag you described.

268
16:56.000 --> 17:01.520
He hasn't made a move because he has feelings for me,

269
17:01.600 --> 17:02.680
but he's just not in love with me yet.

270
17:02.760 --> 17:03.920
But just you wait.

271
17:04.000 --> 17:05.200
One day,

272
17:05.720 --> 17:08.480
I'll become a woman he can't resist.

273
17:18.240 --> 17:19.599
How exactly "can't resist" are we talking?

274
17:24.359 --> 17:28.280
Do you really want to know?

275
17:29.440 --> 17:30.520
Gross.

276
17:31.200 --> 17:33.560
You sure you don't want to know?

277
17:35.480 --> 17:36.960
I'm just wondering…

278
17:37.480 --> 17:39.520
What if you don't become that woman?

279
17:39.600 --> 17:43.000
And even if you do, what if he won't commit to you?

280
17:46.640 --> 17:48.000
Don't blame me for raining on your parade.

281
17:48.080 --> 17:50.080
I looked it up. He's been divorced.

282
17:51.720 --> 17:52.920
He's been divorced!

283
17:53.000 --> 17:54.800
I know. I know. I looked it up too.

284
17:55.400 --> 17:57.360
Miss Bu, why are you such a pessimist?

285
17:57.440 --> 17:59.720
First of all, nothing's even started between us yet.

286
17:59.800 --> 18:01.160
Why think about the ending?

287
18:01.240 --> 18:02.960
Second, in love,

288
18:03.040 --> 18:06.400
the dopamine only lasts about three months on average.

289
18:06.480 --> 18:08.400
Maybe by then I'll be the one who gets bored first.

290
18:09.120 --> 18:11.960
Then he's only good for what I can learn from him.

291
18:12.040 --> 18:15.000
Once I've squeezed him dry, it'll be my turn to…

292
18:22.600 --> 18:24.440
And how exactly are you going to squeeze him dry?

293
18:26.520 --> 18:28.200
Bu Tianna.

294
18:28.280 --> 18:30.960
-Will you cut it out? -Will you…

295
18:31.040 --> 18:32.000
What are you doing?

296
18:32.080 --> 18:32.920
Is this how you squeeze him?

297
18:33.000 --> 18:34.560
Bu Tianna, you… I'm going to hit you.

298
18:34.640 --> 18:35.600
Is this the squeeze?

299
18:35.680 --> 18:36.840
I…

300
18:36.920 --> 18:39.200
Help! Do you still want me to fix your router or not?

301
18:39.280 --> 18:40.880
What are you doing?

302
18:40.960 --> 18:42.560
So you can make dirty jokes about me, but I can't do that to you?

303
18:43.560 --> 18:44.760
You're no fun.

304
18:45.280 --> 18:46.400
Okay, fine.

305
18:46.480 --> 18:47.720
Then hire a repair guy to fix it.

306
18:47.800 --> 18:48.640
Don't ask me to do it.

307
18:48.720 --> 18:50.440
-Because you don't charge. -Are you short on money?

308
18:50.520 --> 18:51.720
Yeah.

309
18:53.480 --> 18:55.840
I just don't want strange men in my place.

310
18:55.920 --> 18:59.760
And most people who fix this stuff are men.

311
19:01.320 --> 19:02.840
But Zhao Heng came by the other day, didn't he?

312
19:03.800 --> 19:06.400
Is he not a stranger, or not a man?

313
19:33.160 --> 19:34.000
‎He…

314
19:36.720 --> 19:38.960
Who is it? Who's there?

315
19:40.000 --> 19:40.880
Who is it?

316
19:42.800 --> 19:44.480
-It's me. -What are you doing here?

317
19:44.560 --> 19:47.120
Didn't your WiFi go down? And your computer too?

318
19:47.200 --> 19:48.320
Last time, I noticed

319
19:48.400 --> 19:50.240
the property management gave you an old router.

320
19:50.320 --> 19:51.480
The signal's bad.

321
19:51.560 --> 19:52.400
This one's better.

322
19:52.480 --> 19:53.680
Did I ask you about the router?

323
19:53.760 --> 19:57.240
I asked why you came to my place without my permission.

324
19:57.320 --> 19:58.520
Because of love.

325
20:02.240 --> 20:03.320
What's wrong?

326
20:03.840 --> 20:06.000
Who's there? Do you have someone over?

327
20:07.880 --> 20:09.520
Speak of the devil.

328
20:09.600 --> 20:11.880
Devil? Are you two talking about me?

329
20:11.960 --> 20:12.800
Putting on a show?

330
20:13.400 --> 20:14.480
Yeah.

331
20:14.560 --> 20:16.360
Fine. I already fixed it for you.

332
20:16.440 --> 20:17.520
I'm heading out.

333
20:18.120 --> 20:20.360
I'll leave you two to it, whether it's just talking or full action.

334
20:20.440 --> 20:21.480
Either way.

335
20:21.560 --> 20:22.720
-I'm off. -Wait.

336
20:23.320 --> 20:25.040
-I'm leaving with you. -Where are you going?

337
20:25.120 --> 20:25.880
Home.

338
20:27.000 --> 20:27.840
Home?

339
20:27.920 --> 20:29.400
You're going home, given how bad things are with your family?

340
20:29.480 --> 20:31.080
What do you mean, bad?

341
20:31.160 --> 20:33.760
I left quietly last time.

342
20:33.840 --> 20:34.960
I didn't burn any bridges.

343
20:35.040 --> 20:39.360
And I'm not going to just follow their script.

344
20:39.440 --> 20:41.760
They're stringing me along. I can string them along too.

345
20:41.840 --> 20:43.560
I'll play the loving daughter

346
20:43.640 --> 20:46.520
while slowly seizing control of Siwei Group.

347
20:46.600 --> 20:47.720
Besides, Bu Tianjie is just a kid.

348
20:47.800 --> 20:49.760
By the time he's old enough to take over,

349
20:49.840 --> 20:52.320
who knows who Siwei Group will belong to.

350
20:52.400 --> 20:53.600
It'll belong to the Bu family.

351
20:55.840 --> 20:57.480
-Let's go. -Wait.

352
20:57.560 --> 20:59.200
You still haven't said how you're going to tell Ye Xinzhi

353
20:59.280 --> 21:00.360
you broke up.

354
21:01.160 --> 21:02.760
I've got an ace up my sleeve.

355
21:02.840 --> 21:04.360
Accidental run-ins work best.

356
21:08.280 --> 21:09.480
Why are you sitting down?

357
21:11.520 --> 21:12.800
And with your shoes on?

358
21:13.640 --> 21:15.160
Aren't I marrying into the family?

359
21:15.680 --> 21:18.320
From now on, just call me "Bu Shoes-On"!

360
21:27.840 --> 21:29.520
Alright. Your license plate is restricted today.

361
21:29.600 --> 21:33.280
I promise I won't stay a minute longer after dropping you off.

362
21:33.800 --> 21:36.240
Stop doubting fate when it brings us together, will you?

363
21:39.400 --> 21:40.640
What fate?

364
21:41.320 --> 21:42.560
Don't flatter yourself.

365
21:43.080 --> 21:44.480
There is no fate between us.

366
21:45.440 --> 21:46.560
So cold-hearted.

367
21:48.640 --> 21:50.000
Zhao Heng, listen.

368
21:50.520 --> 21:53.680
Even if I used your shoulder once when I was down, so what?

369
21:53.760 --> 21:55.880
We are never taking this any further.

370
21:56.640 --> 21:58.600
I never said I needed us to take it further.

371
21:58.680 --> 22:01.160
I actually think we're great just like this.

372
22:03.400 --> 22:05.600
Zhao Heng, I'm telling you this for the very last time.

373
22:05.680 --> 22:07.480
Stop wasting your time on me.

374
22:07.560 --> 22:09.480
It's never going to happen between us.

375
22:09.560 --> 22:13.160
And I'll tell you this one last time too.

376
22:13.800 --> 22:15.000
Relationships take two people.

377
22:15.960 --> 22:17.440
It's not your decision alone to make.

378
22:19.120 --> 22:20.920
How can you be so thick-skinned?

379
22:21.000 --> 22:24.960
I made myself crystal clear, and you're still clinging to me? Why?

380
22:25.040 --> 22:27.480
I don't even like you!

381
22:33.000 --> 22:35.600
I know every single trick you scheming guys like to pull.

382
22:35.680 --> 22:38.080
You're just trying to take advantage of my vulnerability.

383
22:38.160 --> 22:39.640
How would you know so well?

384
22:47.640 --> 22:49.120
Have you been burned by a scheming guy before?

385
22:52.240 --> 22:56.720
You've got looks, talent, and family background.

386
22:56.800 --> 22:59.160
But at your age, you have zero interest in relationships.

387
23:00.120 --> 23:03.960
And you're completely on guard whenever a man gets close.

388
23:04.760 --> 23:06.280
And when you saw Xu Chi and Ye Xinzhi getting close,

389
23:06.360 --> 23:07.240
you kept warning her.

390
23:08.280 --> 23:11.960
I remember you always told us your family favors boys over girls.

391
23:12.040 --> 23:13.240
But I've never heard you

392
23:13.320 --> 23:15.240
mention them pressuring you to get married.

393
23:19.360 --> 23:20.320
I get it now.

394
23:21.560 --> 23:25.160
You must've been deeply hurt by a gentle, mature, scheming guy.

395
23:25.240 --> 23:28.040
Hurt so bad that even your parents don't dare bring it up.

396
23:28.120 --> 23:31.400
Hurt so bad that you're once bitten, twice shy.

397
23:31.480 --> 23:33.120
What does the down payment on your old house have to do with me?

398
23:33.720 --> 23:35.040
What right do you have to have my jewelry appraised?

399
23:35.120 --> 23:37.040
Do you know that was a birthday gift from my dad?

400
23:41.640 --> 23:42.600
Get lost.

401
23:44.360 --> 23:45.640
And he probably got close to you

402
23:45.720 --> 23:47.640
right around when you came back from abroad and found out

403
23:47.720 --> 23:49.000
you had a little brother. Am I wrong?

404
23:49.080 --> 23:51.120
So you're really afraid of me taking advantage of your vulnerability.

405
23:51.200 --> 23:52.040
Pull over.

406
23:52.120 --> 23:53.960
I don't have time for your stories.

407
23:54.680 --> 23:56.080
-I didn't even say anything… -Are you pulling over or not?

408
23:56.160 --> 23:58.440
If you don't, I'll grab the steering wheel right now,

409
23:58.520 --> 23:59.360
and we'll both go down together.

410
24:00.520 --> 24:02.840
You want to die with me? That works too.

411
24:04.000 --> 24:06.720
-One, two… -How can you be so shameless?

412
24:06.800 --> 24:07.720
Didn't your mom teach you any manners?

413
24:17.520 --> 24:18.840
Say whatever you want about me.

414
24:18.920 --> 24:20.400
Just leave my parents out of this.

415
24:20.480 --> 24:22.640
It must take a special kind of toxic parents

416
24:22.720 --> 24:25.440
-to raise someone as shameless as you. -Apologize!

417
24:25.520 --> 24:26.840
Or I'll never talk to you again!

418
24:26.920 --> 24:27.760
You…

419
24:29.080 --> 24:30.120
You better mean it!

420
24:30.840 --> 24:31.680
I've got plenty of simps.

421
24:31.760 --> 24:33.440
One less won't matter.

422
24:48.600 --> 24:50.000
Miss, you're back.

423
25:18.480 --> 25:19.760
No, I'm not going!

424
25:19.840 --> 25:20.880
I'm not getting that shot!

425
25:21.400 --> 25:22.680
So noisy.

426
25:24.280 --> 25:26.200
-Xiaojie. -What's all the racket?

427
25:26.280 --> 25:28.880
Bad guy! Let me go!

428
25:29.560 --> 25:32.560
Mrs. Bu told me to take Xiaojie to get his vaccine before she left,

429
25:32.640 --> 25:33.920
but he just won't cooperate.

430
25:34.000 --> 25:36.440
-Xiaojie, be a good boy. -No!

431
25:36.520 --> 25:38.000
Xiaojie, it really doesn't hurt.

432
25:38.080 --> 25:39.280
-Just go. -Move.

433
25:39.360 --> 25:40.520
Get up!

434
25:41.600 --> 25:43.560
-Miss. -Miss, you…

435
25:44.320 --> 25:45.840
Stay right there. Don't move!

436
25:46.440 --> 25:47.200
You two, step back.

437
25:48.240 --> 25:49.560
So you don't get hurt.

438
26:01.280 --> 26:03.240
-Are you going or not? -No!

439
26:03.320 --> 26:05.400
I'm asking you one last time. Going or not?

440
26:05.480 --> 26:07.800
Not a chance!

441
26:11.560 --> 26:12.520
Are you going or not?

442
26:13.160 --> 26:15.360
Yes. I'll go.

443
26:16.280 --> 26:17.760
There. Nice and easy.

444
26:46.120 --> 26:47.440
This is the place.

445
26:48.560 --> 26:50.480
Based on his habits,

446
26:50.560 --> 26:52.400
he should come at a fixed time every week.

447
27:17.400 --> 27:19.320
-Why is she here? -No idea.

448
27:20.280 --> 27:22.600
Aren't you gonna go say hi?

449
27:24.000 --> 27:25.320
-Okay. Give me a sec. -Alright.

450
27:43.360 --> 27:45.280
-What are you doing here? -I should be asking you.

451
27:45.360 --> 27:47.040
What are you doing here? I've always worked out here.

452
27:49.960 --> 27:52.680
I've been wanting to try some equipment lately.

453
27:53.320 --> 27:56.120
I saw on WeChat that they offer weekend trials.

454
27:56.200 --> 27:57.440
And it's close to my place. Thought I'd check it out.

455
28:01.400 --> 28:02.520
Working hard, huh.

456
28:03.520 --> 28:04.480
It's Saturday.

457
28:05.120 --> 28:06.040
Not out having fun with friends?

458
28:18.440 --> 28:19.280
Um…

459
28:21.080 --> 28:22.280
I broke up.

460
28:32.280 --> 28:33.760
Really?

461
28:33.840 --> 28:34.920
Sorry to hear that.

462
28:37.680 --> 28:38.960
So,

463
28:40.240 --> 28:42.200
I just wanted to come sweat it out today.

464
28:45.240 --> 28:46.200
Yeah.

465
28:48.560 --> 28:49.920
Sweating it out is good.

466
28:50.440 --> 28:53.160
Sweat it all out and you forget all your troubles.

467
28:53.680 --> 28:54.960
For you.

468
28:56.080 --> 28:58.360
I'm going boxing.

469
29:08.680 --> 29:09.800
Ran off.

470
29:10.920 --> 29:11.920
Go boxing?

471
29:12.560 --> 29:13.640
That's it?

472
29:26.200 --> 29:27.280
Can't look back.

473
29:32.560 --> 29:33.800
And I can't leave now either.

474
29:34.920 --> 29:36.800
If I leave, he'll definitely notice.

475
30:08.440 --> 30:11.760
PRIVATE, DO NOT ENTER

476
30:24.040 --> 30:25.760
What is it now?

477
30:30.760 --> 30:31.720
Coming.

478
30:36.200 --> 30:37.640
You tattled again?

479
30:39.360 --> 30:40.800
Tattled about what?

480
30:41.360 --> 30:45.120
I just got home and saw him squirming by the car,

481
30:45.200 --> 30:46.200
refusing to get in.

482
30:46.280 --> 30:49.360
He said he'll only get the vaccine if you take him.

483
30:50.080 --> 30:51.240
I'm not going.

484
30:51.320 --> 30:52.280
I'm busy.

485
30:53.240 --> 30:55.640
You're clearly not working right now.

486
30:55.720 --> 30:57.720
What's the big deal about taking Xiaojie out?

487
30:57.800 --> 31:00.200
It's rare he's so attached to you.

488
31:00.800 --> 31:04.120
Your dad and I both want you two to get along.

489
31:04.640 --> 31:06.320
Just go with him.

490
31:09.640 --> 31:11.560
You really want me to take you?

491
31:12.080 --> 31:13.360
Can I hit him if he doesn't behave?

492
31:13.440 --> 31:15.600
Of course. You're his sister.

493
31:16.760 --> 31:17.960
He's all yours.

494
31:20.400 --> 31:22.960
Just get along, you two. I'm off.

495
31:26.680 --> 31:27.680
Sit.

496
31:55.000 --> 31:56.360
What is wrong with you?

497
31:58.160 --> 31:59.320
Are you alright?

498
31:59.400 --> 32:01.080
I… I'm fine.

499
32:01.960 --> 32:03.600
It's okay. Don't be scared.

500
32:03.680 --> 32:05.640
I… I'm not scared.

501
32:06.760 --> 32:09.040
Oh my. Scared me to death.

502
32:12.360 --> 32:14.840
You really wanted me to come with you that badly?

503
32:16.440 --> 32:17.520
Why?

504
32:18.560 --> 32:20.360
Because shots hurt.

505
32:20.440 --> 32:22.120
You broke wooden boards and didn't feel a thing.

506
32:22.880 --> 32:26.240
I wanted to borrow some of your courage,

507
32:26.320 --> 32:27.400
so it won't hurt as much.

508
32:41.160 --> 32:42.160
Come on.

509
32:46.040 --> 32:47.120
She's gone.

510
32:47.200 --> 32:48.240
Your little girl's gone.

511
32:52.560 --> 32:54.080
She looked so down. Aren't you gonna go after her?

512
32:54.680 --> 32:55.680
No.

513
32:56.520 --> 32:57.600
Let's keep training.

514
33:03.280 --> 33:05.280
Did you take some kind of power pill? That hurt like crazy.

515
33:05.360 --> 33:06.880
You're off today.

516
33:06.960 --> 33:08.360
She leaves, and you take it out on me?

517
33:09.440 --> 33:10.520
Do you keep training or what?

518
33:11.280 --> 33:12.400
Let's… Let's take a break.

519
33:12.480 --> 33:13.640
My hand hurts.

520
33:14.760 --> 33:16.240
What did you two talk about?

521
33:20.360 --> 33:21.200
Nothing much.

522
33:22.120 --> 33:23.800
She just told me

523
33:25.600 --> 33:26.760
she broke up with her boyfriend.

524
33:29.200 --> 33:30.360
Well, that's great!

525
33:30.440 --> 33:31.920
That's good news.

526
33:32.000 --> 33:33.480
She's single,

527
33:33.560 --> 33:35.400
so she'll have more time for work, right?

528
33:35.480 --> 33:37.480
So that gives you an opening. Right?

529
33:40.560 --> 33:41.640
Wait, what opening?

530
33:42.240 --> 33:43.440
-Am I that kind of guy? -Wait. What are you doing?

531
33:43.520 --> 33:47.720
-Hey, am I that kind of guy? -What are you doing?

532
33:47.800 --> 33:49.240
W-What did I say? I…

533
33:49.320 --> 33:50.800
An opening. Like,

534
33:50.880 --> 33:53.720
more chances for you two to work together. What?

535
33:53.800 --> 33:55.080
What were you thinking?

536
33:55.160 --> 33:56.440
What were you thinking?

537
33:56.520 --> 33:58.400
What were you thinking? What were you thinking?

538
34:01.880 --> 34:04.480
Okay, stop. Let's get back to training.

539
34:05.000 --> 34:06.000
-Come on. -Yeah.

540
34:06.080 --> 34:07.160
You really should work out more.

541
34:07.240 --> 34:08.800
Exercise keeps you young.

542
34:08.880 --> 34:12.360
That way, the age gap between you and your little girl

543
34:12.440 --> 34:13.719
won't show as much.

544
34:15.639 --> 34:17.080
Do I look that old?

545
34:17.600 --> 34:18.760
See for yourself.

546
34:38.560 --> 34:39.800
-Don't move. Stay still. -No!

547
34:39.880 --> 34:41.480
-Stay still. Hands down. -I don't want it!

548
34:41.560 --> 34:42.880
Don't move.

549
34:42.960 --> 34:44.400
-Stay still! -Trust me. It won't hurt at all.

550
34:44.480 --> 34:46.159
He's moving so much, I can't give him the shot.

551
34:50.960 --> 34:51.960
Then…

552
34:56.040 --> 34:57.000
Just pretend.

553
34:57.080 --> 34:58.040
Don't actually stick me.

554
35:09.320 --> 35:11.600
Look at me. Watch closely.

555
35:28.840 --> 35:30.560
See that? Doesn't hurt at all.

556
35:32.800 --> 35:34.320
-Did you hear that? -Yeah.

557
35:34.400 --> 35:35.880
Then let's do it.

558
35:56.840 --> 35:59.680
Tianna, did it hurt just now?

559
36:01.160 --> 36:02.840
I'm a karate expert.

560
36:02.920 --> 36:04.040
What's a little pain?

561
36:04.880 --> 36:05.880
Here. Have some candy.

562
36:07.920 --> 36:08.920
I don't like candy.

563
36:09.440 --> 36:10.280
You take it.

564
36:10.360 --> 36:13.960
Even if you're not afraid of pain, shots still hurt.

565
36:14.040 --> 36:15.520
In cartoons,

566
36:15.600 --> 36:18.400
girls feel better after eating candy.

567
36:18.480 --> 36:19.840
Mom won't let me eat candy.

568
36:19.920 --> 36:21.640
She says it'll rot my teeth.

569
36:21.720 --> 36:24.320
I worked so hard to hide this one.

570
36:31.320 --> 36:32.480
What's so great about candy?

571
36:33.600 --> 36:34.680
You keep it.

572
37:00.520 --> 37:01.560
I'll take you for ice cream.

573
37:02.480 --> 37:03.520
Really?

574
37:03.600 --> 37:04.920
You're not lying to me?

575
37:05.440 --> 37:07.120
Ice cream! Ice cream!

576
37:07.680 --> 37:08.680
Stay still.

577
37:08.760 --> 37:10.560
If you move again, I won't take you.

578
37:12.680 --> 37:15.200
I also want donuts.

579
37:16.240 --> 37:17.560
And cotton candy.

580
37:18.280 --> 37:19.320
Tianna, you're my favorite.

581
37:19.400 --> 37:20.320
My favorite!

582
37:24.000 --> 37:24.960
Tianna.

583
37:25.920 --> 37:28.680
Will you be the CEO for me?

584
37:29.360 --> 37:31.360
I don't wanna be a CEO.

585
37:32.000 --> 37:36.920
Dad always says when I grow up, I'll be the CEO.

586
37:37.000 --> 37:40.000
But I don't wanna be busy like Dad every day.

587
37:40.720 --> 37:42.000
I just wanna play.

588
37:44.520 --> 37:45.560
Silly.

589
37:46.200 --> 37:47.400
When you grow up, you won't think that way anymore.

590
38:11.440 --> 38:12.920
What's wrong?

591
38:14.760 --> 38:16.440
No luck with Ye the Legend either?

592
38:24.480 --> 38:29.960
I waited all afternoon just to tell him I'm single now,

593
38:30.040 --> 38:34.280
and he just went, "Oh, really?

594
38:35.080 --> 38:36.400
Well, I'm going boxing."

595
38:38.920 --> 38:41.280
I bet you've never met anyone as delusional as me.

596
38:42.040 --> 38:42.960
There's another one right here.

597
38:43.040 --> 38:44.640
Come on.

598
38:45.760 --> 38:48.520
Fellow losers in love. Come on, forget it.

599
39:10.640 --> 39:12.160
YE THE LEGEND

600
39:14.040 --> 39:15.200
I'm at a meeting by the lake tonight.

601
39:15.280 --> 39:16.560
The moonlight is beautiful.

602
39:16.640 --> 39:17.840
Just wanted to send it to you.

603
39:17.920 --> 39:19.240
Good night. Sleep well.

604
39:19.320 --> 39:21.040
THE MOONLIGHT IS BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT

605
39:21.640 --> 39:22.960
Scumbag.

606
39:23.600 --> 39:25.840
He ignores me, then sends me stuff like this.

607
39:25.920 --> 39:26.760
What does he want?

608
39:30.960 --> 39:31.960
What's wrong?

609
39:40.800 --> 39:41.920
Are you okay?

610
39:42.440 --> 39:44.960
Here, drink this. Tomato juice.

611
39:46.480 --> 39:48.320
I'm fine. I'm not drunk.

612
39:48.400 --> 39:49.360
SONGFENG RESTAURANT

613
39:49.440 --> 39:50.920
Just drink it.

614
39:51.000 --> 39:52.520
Anyone who's drunk says they're not drunk.

615
39:52.600 --> 39:53.720
It's got fructose.

616
39:53.800 --> 39:55.440
It'll make your stomach feel better.

617
39:58.960 --> 40:00.040
Chi.

618
40:00.960 --> 40:03.400
How come I never noticed how caring you are?

619
40:04.360 --> 40:05.440
Oh my God.

620
40:06.480 --> 40:07.560
I…

621
40:08.200 --> 40:10.760
I'm taking care of the guy who's pursuing my best friend.

622
40:10.840 --> 40:12.880
Do you think I'm not acting like enough of a pick-me?

623
40:16.040 --> 40:17.000
What are you doing?

624
40:17.080 --> 40:19.840
Let me run something by you, Chi.

625
40:19.920 --> 40:23.080
Actually, I've always thought we'd be a good match.

626
40:24.080 --> 40:26.760
Look, you've got nothing going on. I'm hopeless too.

627
40:26.840 --> 40:29.320
Let's just get together and piss them off.

628
40:30.360 --> 40:31.400
Go away.

629
40:37.720 --> 40:39.920
Just think about it. Hey, let's talk about it.

630
40:40.680 --> 40:43.040
Go home and sober up.

631
40:43.560 --> 40:44.400
Come on.

632
40:44.920 --> 40:46.680
Go, go, go.

633
40:46.760 --> 40:47.640
Water.

634
40:49.120 --> 40:50.040
Easy.

635
40:52.440 --> 40:57.240
I hope you'll be a new man in 32 hours, okay?

636
40:57.840 --> 40:59.000
How about this?

637
40:59.080 --> 41:00.400
Let's take a photo

638
41:00.920 --> 41:02.760
and post it on Moments. Only they can see it.

639
41:02.840 --> 41:03.920
Piss them off.

640
41:04.000 --> 41:05.080
Get in the car.

641
41:05.160 --> 41:07.200
Just one photo.

642
41:07.280 --> 41:08.440
I'm closing the door.

643
41:09.440 --> 41:10.640
I'm leaving.

644
41:11.600 --> 41:12.640
Bye!

645
41:25.080 --> 41:26.640
Approved. Effective immediately,

646
41:26.720 --> 41:29.880
Xu Chi is transferred to the actuarial team for the Celestial project.

647
41:29.960 --> 41:31.200
MA KE

648
41:31.280 --> 41:33.000
Back then,

649
41:33.080 --> 41:35.560
I suddenly remembered Su Su's WeChat bio.

650
41:36.080 --> 41:39.720
"Love comes and goes, but work is forever."

651
41:40.840 --> 41:45.080
Tomorrow is always a new day.

652
41:58.640 --> 42:01.520
I need a performance measurement tool for the Actuarial Department.

653
42:01.600 --> 42:02.520
Do you have one?

654
42:04.320 --> 42:07.520
Balanced Scorecard or KSF-based total performance compensation?

655
42:07.600 --> 42:10.080
I've seen Lian'an Insurance's in our files. Hold on.

656
42:12.880 --> 42:15.120
Lian'an uses BSC. I'll send it to you.

657
42:15.920 --> 42:19.000
I need the big data utilization rate for Celestial's Actuarial Department.

658
42:19.080 --> 42:20.440
17.3%.

659
42:21.240 --> 42:23.000
You can check data table two.

660
42:23.080 --> 42:24.680
-It has more details. -Okay.

661
42:26.760 --> 42:30.280
By the way, we have a video meeting with external insurance data experts

662
42:30.360 --> 42:31.680
tomorrow at ten.

663
42:31.760 --> 42:34.840
Ma Ke said anyone who wants to ask questions live is welcome to join.

664
42:34.920 --> 42:35.600
Are you guys going?

665
42:35.680 --> 42:36.640
-Yeah. -Yeah.

666
42:57.240 --> 42:58.760
Oh my God.

667
42:58.840 --> 43:01.200
It's only eight in the morning and there's already such a long line.

668
43:01.280 --> 43:03.920
This is the limited-edition black truffle milk tea that's going viral right now.

669
43:04.000 --> 43:05.080
They only sell 200 cups a day.

670
43:05.160 --> 43:07.480
I heard every girl loves it.

671
43:07.560 --> 43:09.320
-Let's go line up. Go. -Let's go.

672
43:14.680 --> 43:15.600
Which flavor are you getting?

673
43:15.680 --> 43:17.720
Black truffle, of course.

674
43:17.800 --> 43:19.120
That's what everyone's here for.

675
43:36.760 --> 43:37.920
Zhao Heng?

676
43:48.240 --> 43:49.400
You're not lining up?

677
43:49.480 --> 43:50.720
Someone bought it for me.

678
43:50.800 --> 43:51.880
Lucky you.

679
43:53.680 --> 43:54.920
Can you save me a spot?

680
44:02.840 --> 44:03.880
Take it.

681
44:04.760 --> 44:06.360
I don't like milk tea.

682
44:09.760 --> 44:12.440
Didn't you say you'd never talk to me again?

683
44:13.040 --> 44:13.960
Then why did you…?
